.balance) }}</span></p><Link href="/receivables" class="mt-3 block text-xs text-amber-700 underline">Ver cartera</Link></div><div><strong class="text-sm">Pagos pendientes</strong><p v-for="item in obligations.payables.slice(0,10)" :key="item.id" class="mt-2 flex justify-between text-xs"><span :class="item.is_overdue ? 'text-destructive' : ''">{{ item.document }} · {{ item.person }}<small class="block">{{ item.due_at || 'Sin vencimiento' }}</small></span><span>{{ money(item.balance) }}</span></p></div></div></article></section>
            <section class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border bg-card"><h3 class="p-4 font-semibold">Documentos que explican las cifras</h3><table class="w-full text-sm"><thead class="border-y bg-muted/40 text-left"><tr><th class="px-4 py-3">Fecha</th><th class="px-4 py-3">Documento</th><th class="px-4 py-3">Tipo</th><th class="px-4 py-3">Descripción</th><th class="px-4 py-3 text-right">Impacto</th></tr></thead><tbody class="divide-y"><tr v-for="item in business.documents" :key="`${item.kind}-${item.id}`"><td class="px-4 py-2">{{ item.date }}</td><td class="px-4 py-2 font-medium">{{ item.document }}</td><td class="px-4 py-2">{{ item.kind }}</td><td class="px-4 py-2">{{ item.description }}</td><td class="px-4 py-2 text-right">{{ money(item.amount) }}</td></tr></tbody></table></section>
